    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a window resize event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is used to represent a window resize event, which includes the width and height of the resized window.</para>
<para>This class represents a window resize event. It is triggered when the size of an application&apos;s window changes. </para>
